<title>USA: Group seeks GRC International board seat.</title>
<headline>Group seeks GRC International board seat.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by Cilluffo Associates said Tuesday it has requested GRC International Inc expand its board by one seat and name Frank Cilluffo to the &quot;newly created directorship.&quot;</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it sent the request in a letter dated October 7 to the company. Cilluffo is a managing general partner in Cilluffo Associates.</p>
<p>The group holds 1,708,000 common shares in GRC or 18.4 percent of the outstanding, the filing said.</p>
</text>
